      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "These initiatives enable us to reduce energy consumption and waste emissions, thereby minimizing our carbon footprint.",
